Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.42,0:00:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Tsuda!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.17,0:00:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to your help the other day,\Nthe project didn't wind up falling through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.43,0:00:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry for having\Ntroubled you with all of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.31,0:00:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Ito,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.77,0:00:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,we're on the same team.\NOf course I'm going to back you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.27,0:00:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, whatever the case...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.27,0:00:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm plenty happy with a simple "thank you."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tsuda!\N- Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.78,0:00:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much! Thank you! Thank—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.37,0:00:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go over the details for\Ntomorrow's presentation. You mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.37,0:00:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'm fine with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.66,0:00:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So, as for features we can\Nadd to the language area...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.63,0:00:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I work for a major\Nelectronics manufacturer,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.34,0:00:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}in the planning department for\NAl-equipped home-use robots,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}which keeps me busy on the daily.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.72,0:00:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, that's it for me for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.72,0:01:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so great about virtual reality?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.73,0:01:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, the section lead said that\NAI wasn't going to take my job!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.90,0:01:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But he can't know that for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.36,0:01:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I {\i1}do{\i0} lose my job to the hot\Nnew Al and wind up unemployed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.69,0:01:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I might die of loneliness\Nin this filthy pit...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.41,0:01:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hire myself a pretty little maid!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.37,0:01:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All-purpose maid robot? Nope!\NMaid cafe? Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.33,0:01:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, they left something\Nthis big unattended?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.38,0:01:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oof, this is heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.29,0:01:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, better open the\Ndoor first! Oh, darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.67,0:01:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.18,0:01:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, please wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.43,0:01:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, master!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.43,0:01:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you sleep well last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.31,0:01:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?\NWhere'd you come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,From the cardboard box at the front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.65,0:01:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That enormous box...!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.65,0:01:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I buy an actual human girl?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.20,0:01:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.66,0:02:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Look. I have a socket\Nhere on the back of my neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.70,0:02:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a gynoid developed for romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.37,0:02:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Nadeshiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.67,0:02:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds shady!\NThis {\i1}has{\i0} to be illegal!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.34,0:02:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm gonna get arrested... and charged..{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.17,0:02:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- {\i1}and fired...\N{\i0}- Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.80,0:02:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,First, just touch me as I go over\Nmy usage functions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.18,0:02:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so soft...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.68,0:02:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I was constructed with an\N"idealized human form" body concept,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and I am outfitted with\Nfinely tuned pressure sensors
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.06,0:02:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,that can respond to even the\Nmost subtle of stimula— mmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.77,0:02:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you feel that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.86,0:02:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.52,0:02:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not even my company has\Nhumanoid robots this elaborate...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.15,0:02:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Master....
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.87,0:02:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did {\i1}that{\i0} come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.16,0:02:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You were staring at my lips,\Nso I thought you wanted a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.54,0:02:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah but I was just thinking it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.46,0:02:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it not feel good?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.71,0:02:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I am certain that my oral\Ncavity's specs are fine, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.17,0:02:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,How about my genitalia?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.72,0:03:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's... downright incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.55,0:03:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If you would insert your finger,\NI can officially register you as my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.01,0:03:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I'm not sure about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.64,0:03:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Then you're a bottom, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.35,0:03:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take everything I say as horny!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.40,0:03:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.73,0:03:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we will conduct master\Nregistration at another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.40,0:03:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Lastly, we'll perform a direct\Ndemonstration of my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.78,0:03:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, relax, and leave everything to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.66,0:03:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wait! Where are you putting that finger?!\N- Do not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.33,0:03:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you I'll guide you to ecstasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.42,0:03:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I have multiple sensors\Nin my tongue and fingertips
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.45,0:03:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,capable of detecting areas of sensitivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.01,0:03:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I am compiling a detailed\Nreport on our sexual activity,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.77,0:03:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,so that the quality of our sexual experience\Nwill improve as we do more things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.56,0:03:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So does that mean...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.82,0:04:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}this girl is going to have a record{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.94,0:04:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}of all my most embarrassing spots?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.08,0:04:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I just activated my finger's vibe function.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.46,0:04:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,By smoothly modulating the strength and direction of the vibration,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I've... never done this before...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.55,0:04:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,in order to increase pleasure...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.55,0:04:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}but it feels so good!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.63,0:04:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I can't stop! Oh, no...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.01,0:04:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Brought to you by [ToonsHub]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.27,0:04:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing you\Nhad the day off from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.35,0:04:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.94,0:04:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to tend to\Nyou all day long, master!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.44,0:04:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think my life might be over...{\i0}
